- Fix Countries List - not displaying names with spaces properly
- Fix API settings limit defaults to 100

TuneFinder 1.3 (08.12.2024)
- Users can now select a program (AmigaAMP) to launch together with TuneFinder
- Added favorites management system
- Added Favorites menu item under Project menu
- Added iconification support
- Added list content preservation during iconification
- Added window position persistence
- Added functionality to save last used country and codec on exit
- Added Fav+ and Fav- buttons for adding/removing favorites
- Added French translation (Eric 'Tarinz' LUCZYSZYN)
- Stations can be saved to and loaded from favorites list
- Renamed Save buttons to 'All' and 'One' for better fit
- Bug fixes and UI improvements

TuneFinder 1.3a (09.12.2024)

- Added Iconify AmigaAMP on start to automatically minimize AmigaAMP

TuneFinder 1.5 (30.10.2026)

- Fixed the Hide Broken and HTTPS Only filters, which had no effect
- Fixed crashes: playing after a new search, quitting from the menu,
  long stream URLs, and several memory leaks (iconify, favorites)
- Searches with short names or tags (1-2 letters) and with accented
  letters (umlauts, Polish letters, ...) now work
- An empty search result is no longer reported as an error
- Plays the direct stream address instead of a playlist URL, so more
  stations start in AmigaAMP
- Playback starts in the background with Connecting/Playing status
- HLS streams are marked and not sent to AmigaAMP; stations that failed
  their last check are shown in italics
- Favorites with '|' in the name or an empty codec are stored correctly
- Status and station details no longer show garbage after redraws
- Connection and AmigaAMP timeouts, no system-wide freezes
- Reports played stations to Radio Browser, as the service asks
- Sorting (name, votes, popularity, bitrate, random) and a "More"
  button for further results
- HTTPS filter is now All / HTTPS only / No HTTPS
- The current track is shown and updated while playing
- More compact window: fits a 640x256 Workbench; the selected station
  is shown on one line with codec, bitrate and full country name
- ARexx port "TUNEFINDER"
- Larger stack; Ctrl-C quits

Special thanks to Flype, Thomas, Ponki1986, Samir, Alexander, Paluch and many others for their help testing TuneFinder!